REALROUTE 0.15
id refinement-preserve
claim_scope defeat-route-ontology
source_ontology O1
target_ontology O2
content x
content y
source_route r root x+y COVERED
target_route rx ax x
target_route ry ay y
map r REFINE rx+ry
coverage_witness r rx x
coverage_witness r ry y
authorize_coverage_authority AUTHORIZED_CONTENT_PRESERVING_TRANSPORT
authorize_coverage_equivalence YES
authorize_duplication NO
authorize_collapse NO
authorize_hidden_novel NO
authorize_ancestry_entanglement NO
authorize_path_conflict NO
END
